<title>USA: Rowe Furniture adopts stock purchase plan.</title>
<headline>Rowe Furniture adopts stock purchase plan.</headline>
<dateline>MCLEAN, Va. 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rowe Furniture Corp said Thursday that it has adopted a dividend reinvestment and stock purchase plan for shareholders.</p>
<p>The plan is being offered through Wachovia Bank of North Carolina, N.A. Shareholders will be mailed detailed information regarding how they can participate in the plan.</p>
